  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook the eggs in boiling water, over medium heat, until soft-boiled, or to your liking, 7-8 minutes.\n• Using tongs, remove the eggs from saucepan and cool in cold water.\n• Peel, then halve the eggs.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa01c1713d196bd6e052a/step-469d0600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Trim and thinly slice pea pods lengthways.\n• Thinly slice carrot into sticks.\n• Roughly chop Asian greens.\n• In a small heatproof bowl, combine garlic, sesame seeds, the soy sauce, vinegar, a good pinch of sugar and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using).\n• In a large frying pan, heat some olive oil (1/2 tbsp per person) over high heat, until just smoking, 30 seconds-1 minute, then carefully pour the oil over the garlic mixture. Set aside.\n• TIP: The hot oil will bubble up and ‘cook’ the garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa01c1713d196bd6e052a/step-8de30010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Re-boil the kettle.\n• Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook udon noodles over medium-high heat, gently stirring with a fork to separate, until tender, 1-2 minutes.\n• Drain, rinse and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa01c1713d196bd6e052a/step-6a99b820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When the oil is hot, add vegetable gyozas, flat-side down, in a single layer.\n• Cook until starting to brown, 1-2 minutes. Add the water (for the gyozas) (watch out, it may spatter!) and cover with a lid (or foil).\n• Cook until the water has evaporated and gyozas are tender and softened, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa01c1713d196bd6e052a/step-5a622930.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the noodles are done, return saucepan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook Hainanese paste and ginger lemongrass paste until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the water (for the soup), Asian greens, carrot, pea pods, soy sauce mix and stock concentrate, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low. Simmer until veggies are just wilted, 2-3 minutes.\n• Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa01c1713d196bd6e052a/step-ac069040.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide cooked noodles and halved jammy eggs between bowls.\n• Pour over broth and top with vegetable gyozas.\n• Drizzle over chilli-sesame oil to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa01c1713d196bd6e052a/step-7c947150.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
